    <string name="help_title">How to connect from Windows</string>
    <string name="help_text">1. Make sure the phone and the computer are on the same Wi-Fi network (or the computer is connected to the phone\'s hotspot).\n2. Start the server here.\n3. On Windows open File Explorer, type the ftp:// address into the address bar and press Enter.\n4. Enter the username and password from the fields above.\n\nFor large transfers, WinSCP or FileZilla (both free) are more reliable.\n\nNote: FTP is not encrypted. Use it only on a network you trust.</string>

